#lego-legacy-route 1
# LEGO Rock Raiders, from its boot through its main menu to its level select.
#
# The boot is first-light.route's: the setup dialog, both movies, the loading
# screen, and the main menu at flip 4603. The pointer moves onto Start Game and
# clicks it. The title brings a fall of rocks down over the menu, drawn in 3D:
# retained mode calls the title's own visuals, and they draw textured triangles
# through the Direct3D device underneath. By flip 4656 the rocks have passed
# and the level select is up, waiting for a cavern to be chosen.
flip 4610 move 320 222
flip 4620 down
flip 4622 up
